---
// Franja verde de Historia — invita a recorrer la línea de tiempo
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-r from-[#018b45] to-[#01a050] py-10 sm:py-12"
  aria-label="Invitación a recorrer la historia"
>
  <!-- Fondo decorativo: años difuminados -->
  <span
    class="pointer-events-none absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 select-none font-display text-[7rem] font-black leading-none text-white/[0.06] sm:text-[10rem]"
    aria-hidden="true">1906</span
  >
  <span
    class="pointer-events-none absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 select-none font-display text-[7rem] font-black leading-none text-white/[0.06] sm:text-[10rem]"
    aria-hidden="true">HOY</span
  >

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-5 text-center md:flex-row md:justify-between md:text-left">

      <!-- Texto izquierdo -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/70">
          Más de un siglo de historia
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
          Recorré el camino
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-white/80 sm:text-base">
          Desde los orígenes en 1906 hasta hoy: hitos, personas y momentos que construyeron el club.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Indicador visual: mini timeline + flecha -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
        <!-- Mini timeline horizontal -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="font-display text-lg font-black text-white/90">1906</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/30" />
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/36" />
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/42" />
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/48" />
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/54" />
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/60" />
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/66" />
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/72" />
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/78" />
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/84" />
            <!-- Punto actual -->
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-white ring-2 ring-white/40 ring-offset-1 ring-offset-transparent" />
          </div>
          <span class="font-display text-lg font-black text-white/90">Hoy</span>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA flecha hacia abajo -->
        <a
          href="#timeline"
          class="group flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-white/80 transition-colors hover:text-white"
          aria-label="Ir a la línea de tiempo"
        >
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Ver línea de tiempo</span>
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="h-6 w-6 animate-bounce"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
